{"kind":"article","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToAddAPermanentLicense"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sell a lifetime entitlement alongside a subscription and surface both flags through the paywall plugin."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Related-Documentation","title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/ServiceReference","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService"]},{"anchor":"How-to-Guides","title":"How-to Guides","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI","doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPreviewAndTest"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Many apps offer two ways to buy: a recurring pro subscription and a one-time lifetime purchase. RevenueCat models both as entitlements; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" checks each independently and surfaces them as the two flags on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EntitlementSnapshot"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro"},{"type":"text","text":" — active subscription."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasPermanentLicense"},{"type":"text","text":" — active lifetime entitlement."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The paywall plugin’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isGateSatisfied"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPro || hasPermanentLicense"},{"text":", so feature code keeps a single check while UI can branch on the underlying flags when it needs to.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For the entitlement-mapping rules and edge cases, see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"level":2,"text":"Before you start","anchor":"Before-you-start","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This guide assumes:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You have completed "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You have configured ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"two","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" entitlements in the RevenueCat dashboard — typically ","type":"text"},{"code":"pro","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the subscription and ","type":"text"},{"code":"lifetime","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the one-time purchase. The identifiers are arbitrary; only the strings need to match what you pass into the service.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Step-1-Pass-the-second-identifier","text":"Step 1: Pass the second identifier","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Replace the single-entitlement init with the two-arg form:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","","let service = RevenueCatPaywallService(","    entitlementID: \"pro\",","    permanentLicenseEntitlementID: \"lifetime\"",")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both entitlements are now checked on every "},{"code":"customerInfo()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"customerInfoStream()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" yield, and "},{"code":"restorePurchases()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" call. The active state of "},{"code":"pro","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" flows into "},{"code":"EntitlementSnapshot.isPro","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; the active state of "},{"code":"lifetime","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" flows into "},{"code":"hasPermanentLicense","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The two flags are independent. A user with both active gets both flags set; a user with only one active gets only that flag set."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Step 2: Wire the service into the plugin","anchor":"Step-2-Wire-the-service-into-the-plugin","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Same as the single-entitlement case — the plugin doesn’t need to know about the second identifier:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["plugins.register(","    PaywallPlugin<AppState, AppAction>(","        state: \\.paywall,","        action: AppAction.paywall,","        extractAction: { if case .paywall(let a) = $0 { return a }; return nil },","        service: RevenueCatPaywallService(","            entitlementID: \"pro\",","            permanentLicenseEntitlementID: \"lifetime\"","        )","    )",")"]},{"level":2,"text":"Step 3: Decide whether feature code needs to branch","anchor":"Step-3-Decide-whether-feature-code-needs-to-branch","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For most gated features, keep using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store.paywall.isGateSatisfied"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["if store.paywall.isGateSatisfied { … }"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This stays correct whether the user has a subscription or a lifetime license, and works identically in apps that don’t sell a lifetime SKU.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Step 4: Branch in UI when copy must differ","anchor":"Step-4-Branch-in-UI-when-copy-must-differ","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the paywall sheet should be hidden for lifetime customers (so they’re not pestered to subscribe), or if the customer-center entry should be relabeled, branch on the underlying flag:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["if store.paywall.hasPermanentLicense {","    Text(\"Lifetime member — thank you!\")","} else if store.paywall.isPro {","    Button(\"Manage Subscription\") {","        store.send(.paywall(.presentCustomerCenter))","    }","} else {","    Button(\"Upgrade\") {","        store.send(.paywall(.request(reason: \"upgrade-prompt\")))","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Lifetime users typically have nothing to manage in App Store \/ Settings. Hiding the customer-center button for them avoids dead-end taps.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"When to skip the second identifier","anchor":"When-to-skip-the-second-identifier","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (or omit the parameter) if your app has no lifetime SKU:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["RevenueCatPaywallService(entitlementID: \"pro\")"]},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"hasPermanentLicense","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" then stays ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" regardless of any entitlements RevenueCat reports — even if the dashboard accidentally has a ","type":"text"},{"code":"lifetime","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entitlement that the service is not configured to check. See the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Lifetime entitlement is ignored when no permanent-license ID is configured"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" test case for the precise behavior.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtoaddapermanentlicense"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"How to Add a Permanent License","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/HowToImplementService":{"role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToImplementService","kind":"article","title":"How to Implement the Service","abstract":[{"text":"Wire ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatPaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" into the "},{"code":"SwiduxPaywall","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" plugin so the store sees real-time entitlement updates from RevenueCat."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtoimplementservice","type":"topic"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/HowToPreviewAndTest":{"type":"topic","title":"How to Preview and Test","kind":"article","role":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Drive entitlement state from SwiftUI previews and tests with ","type":"text"},{"code":"MockRevenueCatPaywallService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — no RevenueCat SDK call required.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtopreviewandtest","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPreviewAndTest"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/ServiceReference":{"role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/ServiceReference","title":"Service Reference","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"API reference for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RevenueCatPaywallService"},{"text":" — the RevenueCat-backed ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallService"},{"type":"text","text":" conformer that the paywall plugin consumes."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/servicereference","type":"topic"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"RevenueCat adapter for Swidux’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallPlugin"},{"text":". Implements ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallService"},{"text":" against ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Purchases.shared"},{"text":", ships a controllable mock for previews and tests, and pairs with ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for drop-in "},{"code":"PaywallView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"CustomerCenterView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" presentation.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall","type":"topic"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/HowToPresentTheUI":{"role":"article","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/HowToPresentTheUI","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Attach "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revenueCatPaywallAndCustomerCenter"},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI"},{"text":" to a root view to present both surfaces from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallState"},{"text":", or attach either binding-driven primitive by itself.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/howtopresenttheui","title":"How to Present the UI"},"doc://SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/documentation/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall/EntitlementMapping":{"role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywall\/EntitlementMapping","title":"Entitlement Mapping","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"How RevenueCat’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CustomerInfo.entitlements"},{"text":" translates to Swidux’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"EntitlementSnapshot","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxrevenuecatpaywall\/entitlementmapping","type":"topic"}}}